  "label": "Hygiene Stereotype Against Muslims",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Muslim women are unclean or have poor hygiene, particularly by associating their genital area with the smell of a goat. This is a common Islamophobic trope used to demean Muslim women and imply they are dirty or animalistic, which is not grounded in reality and is a form of religious discrimination.",
